with a cross-attention layer.

262
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:53,420
And we do this using
basically a learned query.

263
00:10:53,420 --> 00:10:57,260
And so we're replacing only
the query from the input here

264
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:58,880
with a learned component.

265
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,410
And so these indices
and channels,

266
00:11:00,410 --> 00:11:02,077
you can just think
of these as basically

267
00:11:02,077 --> 00:11:05,030
