names that this idea

269
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:09,410
goes under in the literature.

270
00:11:09,410 --> 00:11:13,010
We refer to them as latents.

271
00:11:13,010 --> 00:11:15,290
But they're sometimes
called inducing

272
00:11:15,290 --> 00:11:17,463
