291
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:05,710
So we have full control over
this as a hyperparameter.

292
00:12:05,710 --> 00:12:10,160
And this allows us to build deep
networks on top of this latent.

293
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:12,610
So because this is of a small
size that we can control,

294
00:12:12,610 --> 00:12:15,740
