467
00:19:03,690 --> 00:19:08,100
a sense, so each of the
input points is assigned.

468
00:19:08,100 --> 00:19:11,070
Basically, so you'll
be some position here.

469
00:19:11,070 --> 00:19:14,490
And we have sinusoidal and
