496
00:20:22,110 --> 00:20:25,382
the content embedding is not
as sparse as it is in language.

497
00:20:25,382 --> 00:20:26,340
We're not totally sure.

498
00:20:26,340 --> 00:20:30,117
But this is something that
I observed consistently.

499
00:20:30,117 --> 00:20:31,450
And before I move on to results.

500
00:20:31,450 --> 00:20:34,530
I just want to contrast this
to some other approaches

501
00:20:34,530 --> 00:20:38,520
for using transformers
