507
00:20:54,730 --> 00:20:57,000
So one is that-- so
vision transformers

508
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:58,800
do use an input 2D convolution.

509
00:20:58,800 --> 00:21:00,720
So this is often
phrased in terms

510
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:04,440
