512
00:21:05,580 --> 00:21:10,380
So it does restrict the class
of inputs you can use it for.

513
00:21:10,380 --> 00:21:13,890
And because we're basically
building this patching

514
00:21:13,890 --> 00:21:16,260
or convolution
into it, this means

515
00:21:16,260 --> 00:21:19,020
that this has an approach
really isn't sufficient to get

516
00:21:19,020 --> 00:21:20,370
it to work on non-grid data.

517
00:21:20,370 --> 00:21:21,660
There are other ways
you could adapt it,

518
00:21:21,660 --> 00:21:23,118
but this is something
that you will

519
00:21:23,118 --> 00:21:26,520
