tends to have fewer features.

763
00:31:19,220 --> 00:31:21,688
And it only has a 1D
positional encoding.

764
00:31:21,688 --> 00:31:23,480
So the way that we
handle this is basically

765
00:31:23,480 --> 00:31:27,720
