specific position encodings.

766
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:29,270
And so these are
basically embeddings

767
00:31:29,270 --> 00:31:32,810
that are special and learned
for each of the modalities.

768
00:31:32,810 --> 00:31:35,180
And what this does is
basically tags-- ends up

769
00:31:35,180 --> 00:31:38,180
