distinguish which one's which.

772
00:31:42,680 --> 00:31:47,060
But given these padded, these
sort of learned, padded feature

773
00:31:47,060 --> 00:31:49,010
vectors, we then
concatenate them all.

774
00:31:49,010 --> 00:31:51,328
And that's how we
process multimodal data.

775
00:31:51,328 --> 00:31:53,120
So basically, the input
to the architecture

776
00:31:53,120 --> 00:31:54,860
